sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as iPadOS Client
    participant MW as SessionAuthMiddleware
    participant Neo4j as Neo4j Graph DB
    participant Router as FastAPI Router Handler

    Note over Client,Router: Registration / Login Flow
    Client->>Router: POST /students/login {student_number}
    Router->>Neo4j: Query Student & MATCH student_number
    Router->>Router: Generate token = secrets.token_urlsafe(32)
    Router->>Router: Compute token_hash = SHA256(token)
    Router->>Neo4j: CREATE Session {token_hash, expires_at: now + 30d}
    Router-->>Client: 200 OK {token, expires_at}
    Client->>Client: Store token securely in KeychainStore

    Note over Client,Router: Authenticated API Invocation
    Client->>MW: GET /students/me/profile Header: Authorization Bearer token
    MW->>MW: Check URL vs Allowlist Regex
    MW->>MW: Extract raw token & compute SHA256
    MW->>Neo4j: MATCH Student HAS_SESSION Session {token_hash} WHERE not revoked AND not expired
    alt Session Valid
        Neo4j-->>MW: Return student_id
        MW->>MW: request.state.student_id = student_id
        MW->>Router: Forward request to route handler
        Router-->>Client: 200 OK {profile data}
    else Session Expired / Revoked / Invalid
        MW-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized
    end
